          "markdownContent": "A **screen** is a route: a `page.dart` under `lib/app/`. **Open** runs from the tap to its first frame (redirects and guards included). **Content** is the `data.dart` load that follows. Colours as on App health: 🟢 good · 🟠 needs attention · 🔴 bad · grey: not enough data yet."
